        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Beth Quist\n- Products: Santour, Santoor\n- Places: Iran, Jammu and Kashmir\n- Topics: Musical instruments, Vocal range\n\nFacts:\n- Beth Quist has a 4-octave soprano voice.\n- Beth Quist plays piano, keyboards, santour, dumbek, guitar, flute, and other instruments.\n- The santour is a hammered dulcimer.\n- The santoor is the national musical instrument of Iran.\n- The santoor is also native to Jammu and Kashmir.",
